{"id":56577,"date":"2025-05-14T09:07:19","title":{"rendered":"M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 v\u00e0 b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-one-full fusion-column-first fusion-column-last\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-column-wrapper-legacy\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, m\u1eb7c d\u00f9 kinh t\u1ebf th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi v\u00e0 trong n\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c g\u1eb7p nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n, th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c nh\u01b0ng c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh, c\u00e1c c\u1ea5p t\u1eeb Trung \u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u00e3 quy\u1ebft li\u1ec7t th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p \u0111\u1ec1 ra trong Ngh\u1ecb quy\u1ebft, Ch\u1ec9 th\u1ecb c\u1ee7a Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 v\u00e0 Th\u1ee7 t\u01b0\u1edbng Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 v\u1ec1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u1eb1m \u0111\u1ea1t k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng kinh t\u1ebf n\u0103m 2025. T\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 v\u00e0 b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc ta duy tr\u00ec xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c, kinh t\u1ebf v\u0129 m\u00f4 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, l\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t trong t\u1ea7m ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t; c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh, l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 quan tr\u1ecdng, t\u1ea1o \u0111\u00e0 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng cho c\u00e1c th\u00e1ng, qu\u00fd ti\u1ebfp theo. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng v\u1ec1 kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 v\u00e0 b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc ta nh\u01b0 sau:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(1) Ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 gieo c\u1ea5y l\u00faa \u0111\u00f4ng xu\u00e2n v\u00e0 l\u00faa h\u00e8 thu t\u0103ng so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; ch\u0103n nu\u00f4i l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh,<\/em> <em>d\u1ecbch b\u1ec7nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t; k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t l\u00e2m nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ea1t kh\u00e1; khai th\u00e1c v\u00e0 nu\u00f4i tr\u1ed3ng th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n t\u0103ng kh\u00e1 nh\u1edd th\u1eddi ti\u1ebft thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i, gi\u00e1 d\u1ea7u gi\u1ea3m v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n t\u0103ng cao.<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y 20\/4\/2025, c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc gieo c\u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c 2.968,0 ngh\u00ecn ha l\u00faa \u0111\u00f4ng xu\u00e2n, t\u0103ng 15,7 ngh\u00ecn ha so v\u1edbi v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f4ng xu\u00e2n n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00eda Nam gieo c\u1ea5y 719,9 ngh\u00ecn ha l\u00faa h\u00e8 thu, t\u0103ng 5,1%. Ch\u0103n nu\u00f4i l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n t\u1ed1t nh\u1edd ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ecbch b\u1ec7nh. T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 4\/2025, t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 l\u1ee3n c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 3,0% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 gia c\u1ea7m t\u0103ng 3,5%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u1ed3ng r\u1eebng v\u00e0 khai th\u00e1c g\u1ed7 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n t\u1ed1t. Di\u1ec7n t\u00edch r\u1eebng tr\u1ed3ng m\u1edbi t\u1eadp trung c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc th\u00e1ng 4\/2025 \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 32,2 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 1,1% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng g\u1ed7 khai th\u00e1c \u0111\u1ea1t 1.623,3 ngh\u00ecn m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 6,6%. T\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, di\u1ec7n t\u00edch r\u1eebng tr\u1ed3ng m\u1edbi c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ea1t 77,8 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 11,3%; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng g\u1ed7 khai th\u00e1c \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 5.951,4 ngh\u00ecn m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 12,4%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khai th\u00e1c th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n g\u1eb7p nhi\u1ec1u thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i do v\u00e0o th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m khai th\u00e1c v\u1ee5 c\u00e1 Nam, gi\u00e1 d\u1ea7u gi\u1ea3m m\u1ea1nh n\u00ean ng\u01b0 d\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u1ef1c ra kh\u01a1i. S\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n khai th\u00e1c trong th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea1t 356,6 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 0,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n nu\u00f4i tr\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ea1t 437,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 4,7%, trong \u0111\u00f3 t\u00f4m \u0111\u1ea1t 98,3 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 6,0%. T\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, t\u1ed5ng s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 2.787,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 2,8% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, trong \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng khai th\u00e1c \u0111\u1ea1t 1.236,4 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 0,3%; nu\u00f4i tr\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ea1t 1.551,4 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 4,9%, ri\u00eang s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f4m \u0111\u1ea1t 268,3 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 5,7%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 1. S\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u1ee7y s\u1ea3n 4 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 <\/strong><strong>so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m 2024<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-56583\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27215%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20660%20215%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27215%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"215\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(2) S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng cao nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2022-2025. <\/em>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 \u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 8,9% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 t\u0103ng 8,4%, l\u00e0 m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng cao nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 c\u00e1c n\u0103m trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 2022-2025<a href=\"#_ftn1\" name=\"_ftnref1\">[1]<\/a>, trong \u0111\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t ng\u00e0nh ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn, ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1o t\u0103ng 10,1% (c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 6,5%). M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p tr\u1ecdng \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u0103ng cao nh\u01b0: S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t xe c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u01a1 t\u0103ng 35,1%; s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t da v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 li\u00ean quan t\u0103ng 16,7%; s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb cao su v\u00e0 plastic t\u0103ng 16,4%; s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t trang ph\u1ee5c t\u0103ng 15,7%; ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn g\u1ed7 v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb g\u1ed7, tre, n\u1ee9a t\u0103ng 15,2% &#8230;<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 2. 10 \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u00f3 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng IIP 4<\/strong><strong> th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u<\/strong><strong> n\u0103m 2025 so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong> <strong>cao nh\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc (%)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-56582 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27558%27%20height%3D%27239%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20558%20239%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27558%27%20height%3D%27239%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"558\" height=\"239\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(3) <\/em><em>Ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, du l\u1ecbch s\u00f4i \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 <\/em><em>duy tr\u00ec m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng cao so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/em><em>.<\/em> T\u1ed5ng m\u1ee9c b\u00e1n l\u1ebb v\u00e0 doanh thu d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 t\u0103ng 11,1% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, t\u1ed5ng m\u1ee9c b\u00e1n l\u1ebb h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a v\u00e0 doanh thu d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng t\u0103ng 9,9%. V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0nh kh\u00e1ch b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 t\u0103ng 19,2% v\u00e0 lu\u00e2n chuy\u1ec3n t\u0103ng 13%; v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a t\u0103ng 14,7% v\u00e0 lu\u00e2n chuy\u1ec3n t\u0103ng 11,5%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong th\u00e1ng T\u01b0 \u0111\u1ea1t 1,65 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t kh\u00e1ch, t\u0103ng 6,3% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m \u0111\u1ea1t 7,67 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t kh\u00e1ch, t\u0103ng 23,8% v\u00e0 l\u00e0 s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ebfn n\u01b0\u1edbc ta \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c cao nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m trong nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m qua.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 3. Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam 4 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 <\/strong><strong>ph\u00e2n theo v\u00f9ng l\u00e3nh th\u1ed5<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-56581\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27331%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20660%20331%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27331%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"331\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ed5ng kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u1ea1t 276,89 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 15,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, trong \u0111\u00f3 xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 13,0%; nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 18,6%. C\u00e1n c\u00e2n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a xu\u1ea5t si\u00eau 3,79 t\u1ef7 USD.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 4. Xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a 4 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-56580\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27221%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20660%20221%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27221%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"221\" \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(4) \u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 t\u1eeb ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1eadp trung \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh. <\/em>V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 t\u1eeb ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 165,6 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 18,6% k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch n\u0103m v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 17,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc (c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m 2024<a href=\"#_ftn2\" name=\"_ftnref2\">[2]<\/a> b\u1eb1ng 18,0% v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 4,4%).<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 5. V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc 4 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng (T\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload alignnone size-full wp-image-56579 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27606%27%20height%3D%27275%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20606%20275%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27606%27%20height%3D%27275%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"606\" height=\"275\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(5) T\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1ed5 sung v\u00e0o n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf t\u0103ng cao. <\/em>Trong b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1ed5 sung v\u00e0o n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ea1t 1.79 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, t\u0103ng 91,3% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, trong \u0111\u00f3 v\u1ed1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u0103ng th\u00eam c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ea1t g\u1ea7n 1.304 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, t\u0103ng 217,1%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(6)<\/em> <em>L\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t theo m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 ra. <\/em>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng (CPI) b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025 t\u0103ng 3,20% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng 3,84% v\u00e0 3,93% c\u1ee7a c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m 2023 v\u00e0 2024. L\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n t\u0103ng 3,05%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(7) T\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t kinh doanh, du l\u1ecbch, th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n l\u00e0m t\u0103ng ngu\u1ed3n thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc. <\/em>T\u00ednh chung b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025, thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 944,1 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 48,0% d\u1ef1 to\u00e1n n\u0103m v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 26,3% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 6. Thu, chi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc 4 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2025<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload wp-image-56578 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27275%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20660%20275%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27660%27%20height%3D%27275%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"275\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref1\" name=\"_ftn1\">[1]<\/a> Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2022-2025 so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea7n l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u0103ng\/gi\u1ea3m l\u00e0: 7,8%; -2,5%; 6,3%; 8,4%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref2\" name=\"_ftn2\">[2]<\/a> V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc b\u1ed1n th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 140,7 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"fusion-clearfix\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-2 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-1 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-color:#f2f2f2;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-2\"><hr \/>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-fusion-800 wp-image-41615 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20800%20146%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-200x37.png 200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-300x55.png 300w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-400x73.png 400w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-600x110.png 600w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-768x141.png 768w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png 800w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1024x187.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1200x220.png 1200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1536x281.png 1536w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-2 fusion_builder_column_1_6 1_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:16.666666666667%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:11.52%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:11.52%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-3 fusion_builder_column_5_6 5_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:83.333333333333%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:2.304%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:2.304%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\"><div class=\"document-type-news\"><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/10\/nhung-tin-hieu-tich-cuc-cua-thi-truong-lao-dong-trong-9-thang-nam-2026\/\">Nh\u1eefng t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026 c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u chuy\u1ec3n bi\u1ebfn t\u00edch c\u1ef1c. L\u1ef1c l\u01b0\u1ee3ng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m t\u0103ng, thu nh\u1eadp b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n th\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi lao \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n; t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng thi\u1ebfu vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m, lao \u0111\u1ed9ng phi ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 lao \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1ebft ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m. \u0110\u00e1ng ch\u00fa \u00fd, c\u01a1 c\u1ea5u lao \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ecbch theo h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng khu v\u1ef1c n\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong khu v\u1ef1c c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng, khu v\u1ef1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m trong c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ed1 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng. <span>(12\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/08\/phat-trien-y-hoc-co-truyen-viet-nam-gan-voi-cham-soc-suc-khoe-nhan-dan-va-phat-trien-dat-nuoc\/\">Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n Vi\u1ec7t Nam g\u1eafn v\u1edbi ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u1eafn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi gi\u1eef g\u00ecn b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc v\u0103n h\u00f3a d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u1ec7u, kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao s\u1ee9c m\u1ea1nh m\u1ec1m qu\u1ed1c gia. V\u00ec v\u1eady, c\u1ea7n b\u1ea3o t\u1ed3n, ph\u00e1t huy v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, bi\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb, di s\u1ea3n qu\u00fd b\u00e1u c\u1ee7a cha \u00f4ng th\u00e0nh ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc trong th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 m\u1edbi. <span>(10\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/hoan-thien-quy-dinh-ve-pho-bien-thong-tin-thong-ke-quoc-gia\/\">Ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch c\u00f3 vai tr\u00f2 quan tr\u1ecdng trong c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 13\/2026\/N\u0110-CP ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u01a1 s\u1edf ph\u00e1p l\u00fd v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1, cung c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/chuan-hoa-che-do-bao-cao-thong-ke-cap-quoc-gia-phuc-vu-cong-tac-quan-ly-va-dieu-hanh\/\">Chu\u1ea9n h\u00f3a ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>D\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 139\/2026\/N\u0110-CP g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia; n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cung c\u1ea5p, t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/thong-ke-noi-vung-bien\/\">Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea n\u01a1i v\u00f9ng bi\u00ean<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>18 n\u0103m l\u00e0m ngh\u1ec1, anh Nguy\u1ec5n V\u0103n To\u00e0n, Tr\u01b0\u1edfng Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u01a1 s\u1edf N\u00e0 H\u1ef3, t\u1ec9nh \u0110i\u1ec7n Bi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 qu\u00ean nh\u1eefng l\u1ea7n c\u00f9ng \u0103n, c\u00f9ng ng\u1ee7 v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u00e0o d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c L\u00e0o, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c M\u00f4ng, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c Th\u00e1i. <span>(06\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/nganh-thong-ke-hoi-nhap-tinh-toan-gdp-theo-chuan-quoc-te\/\">Ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp, t\u00ednh to\u00e1n GDP theo chu\u1ea9n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>S\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a U\u1ef7 ban Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Li\u00ean H\u1ee3p qu\u1ed1c, UNDP, WB, ADB, IFC, ILO nh\u1eefng n\u0103m sau \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea, n\u00e2ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t Nam theo chu\u1ea9n m\u1ef1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf. <span>(05\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"document-type-archive\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><a href=\"\/tin-tuc-khac\">Xem th\u00eam<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-4 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-widget-area awb-widget-area-element fusion-widget-area-1 fusion-content-widget-area post-taxonomy-metadata\" style=\"--awb-title-color:#333333;--awb-padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-additional-widget-content\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/p>\n","protected":false}}